Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Intro::
    .string "MECHADOLL 1: Halt! Answer me and\n"
    .string "the door is yours!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz1::
    .string "Of these three, which one flies?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz2::
    .string "Which of these three is part\n"
    .string "NORMAL type?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz3::
    .string "Which of these three is a BUG and\n"
    .string "a POISON type?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Intro::
    .string "MECHADOLL 2: My questions are\n"
    .string "harder. The MASTER says so.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz1::
    .string "Which of these three collects\n"
    .string "whatever it finds on the ground?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz2::
    .string "Which of these three becomes\n"
    .string "LINOONE?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz3::
    .string "Which of these three becomes\n"
    .string "MIGHTYENA?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Intro::
    .string "MECHADOLL 3: I do sums. The\n"
    .string "MASTER is bad at sums.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz1::
    .string "At the MART, which costs more: a\n"
    .string "BURN HEAL or HARBOR MAIL?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz2::
    .string "You pay for one POKé BALL with\n"
    .string "exactly its price.\p"
    .string "What change do you get?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz3::
    .string "Set against an ULTRA BALL, a\n"
    .string "GREAT BALL costs…?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Intro::
    .string "MECHADOLL 4: I watch the house. I\n"
    .string "have watched you since the door.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz1::
    .string "The TRICK MASTER. Man or woman?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz2::
    .string "Among the dolls in this house,\n"
    .string "who is there more of?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz3::
    .string "How many doors have you opened in\n"
    .string "this room?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Intro::
    .string "MECHADOLL 5: The last of us.\n"
    .string "Count carefully.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz1::
    .string "How many trainers wait in each of\n"
    .string "the battling rooms?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz2::
    .string "How many POKéMON may a trainer\n"
    .string "carry at once?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz3::
    .string "How many rooms does the TRICK\n"
    .string "HOUSE have in all?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_CorrectGoThrough::
    .string "MECHADOLL: Correct! Correct!\p"
    .string "Pass, and tell the MASTER I was\n"
    .string "difficult.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_DisappointmentError::
    .string "MECHADOLL: Error. Error.\p"
    .string "Disappointment.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Wahahahaha::
    .string "TRICK MASTER: Wahahahaha!\p"
    .string "My dolls are merciless!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_WaitForNextChallenge::
    .string "MECHADOLL: Standing by. Standing\n"
    .string "by. Standing by.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened::
    .string "{PLAYER} wrote the secret word on\n"
    .string "the door.\p"
    .string "The lock turned itself over and\n"
    .string "the door swung wide.$"
